/****************************************************************************
 * arch/arm/src/stm32n6/stm32n6_video.c
 *
 * STM32N6 V4L2 camera capture driver (/dev/video0).
 *
 * Wraps the DCMIPP + IMX335 drivers behind the NuttX V4L2 character
 * device framework (video_register + v4l2_ops).  The DCMIPP PIPE1
 * demosaics the IMX335 RAW10 CSI-2 stream into RGB565 800x480 directly
 * into the shared LTDC framebuffer (no extra 768KB capture buffer is
 * affordable in SRAM), so:
