 *   - read()           blocks until a frame completes, then copies the
 *                      800x480 RGB565 frame to the caller
 *   - VIDIOC_DQBUF     is a thin alias of read (single-buffer mode)
 *   - VIDIOC_STREAMOFF stops capture
 *
 * The frame-complete interrupt (P1FRAMEF) is delivered to this driver
 * through stm32n6_dcmipp_set_frame_callback() from ISR context.
